[en.DECISION_C15_EXPEDITION_NORTH]
Expedition To The North

[en.DECISION_C15_EXPEDITION_NORTH_desc]
Organize a scientific expedition to the frozen north to conduct scientific research and resource exploration. There may be valuable discoveries.

[zh.DECISION_C15_EXPEDITION_NORTH]
一路向北

[zh.DECISION_C15_EXPEDITION_NORTH_desc]
组织科学考察队到冰封北境进行科学考察和资源勘探，也许会有宝贵的发现。
